    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A thick, rubbery daelkyr organism that attaches to the base of your spine. The leech feeds constantly on your blood, imparting the drained 1 condition while it remains invested (this condition cannot be removed until the leech is uninvested). In return, the creature absorbs devastating physical shock: you gain complete immunity to the extra damage from critical hits and precision damage, treating all critical hits against you as normal hits.</p>"
